{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00411","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 豫和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 豫和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大号成命，思文配天。\n神光肸蠁，龙驾言旋。\n眇眇阊阖，昭昭上玄。\n俾昌而大，於斯万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}